  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">BRA/18/G31 Phytotherapic V Cha-UNDP-BRA-00110219</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">The project is set to enhance global biodiversity benefits, as well as multiple national and local co-benefits, arising from the sustainable, accessible, and innovative use of medicinal plants in Brazilian ecosystems. It will do so by strengthening promising phytotherapic value chains, based on indigenous and local communities&#x2019; traditional knowledge, in compliance with the applicable ABS regime, and while adhering to ecological sustainability criteria.</narrative>
  </description>
